; hledger journal. The ONLY source of money figures for your agent.
; One transaction per entry; the agent appends here and reports with `hledger` commands.
; Docs: https://hledger.org/1.32/hledger.html
; Example entries (delete these once real ones exist):

2026-01-05 * Example Client | invoice 001 paid
    assets:bank            1000.00 USD
    income:clients

2026-01-08 * hosting
    expenses:infrastructure  12.00 USD
    assets:bank
